TITLE:: SpiralView
summary:: Spiral's display
categories:: Libraries>Spiral
related:: Classes/Spiral, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Spiral's window. In it, drag along for the shift (fine near the middle), up and down for the feedback; the wheel for the delay. It draws where a 440 Hz note goes, trip by trip: what the numbers do to one partial, not what is playing now.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

